{"id":42974,"date":"2025-07-06T21:29:00","date_gmt":"2025-07-06T20:29:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-trail-serra-da-freita-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:50:09","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:50:09","slug":"ultra-trail-serra-da-freita","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-trail-serra-da-freita\/","title":{"rendered":"Ultra Trail Serra da Freita 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ultra Trail Serra da Freita 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XXI Ultra Trail Serra da Freita 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>26 e 27 de Junho de 2027<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica vila de <strong>Arouca<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Pioneiro do trail running em Portugal e organizado pela hist\u00f3rica <strong>Confraria Trotamontes<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Arouca<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 uma das provas de montanha mais lend\u00e1rias, t\u00e9cnicas e respeitadas da Pen\u00ednsula Ib\u00e9rica, atravessando os geoss\u00edtios \u00fanicos do <strong>Arouca Geopark UNESCO<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas na Pra\u00e7a Brand\u00e3o de Vasconcelos e meta na Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Arouca, as provas rainhas de <strong>Elite 100 km (6900m D+)<\/strong> e <strong>Ultra 65 km (4200m D+)<\/strong> partem \u00e0s <strong>06h00<\/strong>, seguindo-se o <strong>Trail 31 km (1800m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail 19 km (1000m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong>. O circuito desafia os atletas pelas cristas agrestes da Serra da Freita, Frecha da Mizarela, Pedras Parideiras e vales do Rio Arda e Paiva, disponibilizando apoio t\u00e9cnico refor\u00e7ado, base de vida, medalha finisher m\u00edtica e a tradicional vitela arouquesa no encerramento.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; le