ncelho de <strong>Arouca<\/strong> (Aveiro).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis das provas principais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui a <strong>Elite 100 km (6900m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Ultra 65 km (4200m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail 31 km (1800m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail 19 km (1000m D+)<\/strong> e a Caminhada de 12 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que locais emblem\u00e1ticos passa o percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas percorrem os trilhos do Arouca Geopark UNESCO, incluindo a Frecha da Mizarela, as Pedras Parideiras, a aldeia de Drave e o vale do Paiva.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova dos 100 km pode ser disputada em equipas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza a vertente de estafetas por equipas de 4 elementos para a dist\u00e2ncia dos 100 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/ultra-trail-serra-da-freita-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">StopAndGo<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Trail Serra da Freita 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-06-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a Brand\u00e3o de Vasconcelos (Partida) \u00e0 Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Arouca, Aveiro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Arouca\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Confraria Trotamontes e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Arouca\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Ultra Trail Serra da Freita 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 26 e 27 de Junho de 2027 , no concelho de Arouca (Aveiro).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis das provas principais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento inclui a Elite 100 km (6900m D+) , o Ultra 65 km (4200m D+) , o Trail 31 km (1800m D+) , o Mini Trail 19 km (1000m D+) e a Caminhada de 12 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Por que locais emblem\u00e1ticos passa o percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas percorrem os trilhos do Arouca Geopark UNESCO, incluindo a Frecha da Mizarela, as Pedras Parideiras, a aldeia de Drave e o vale do Paiva.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova dos 100 km pode ser disputada em equipas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza a vertente de estafetas por equipas de 4 elementos para a dist\u00e2ncia dos 100 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma StopAndGo .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":53197,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-42974","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-arouca-aveiro","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/396fddacab39f831488e0bcc1a816178.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/42974","targetHints":{"allow